{"unit_id": "tag:07ZH:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）分次（graded）<MATH_0005>代数（algebras）。令<MATH_0006>、<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>。设<MATH_0009>、<MATH_0010>为分次（graded）<MATH_0011>代数（algebra）映射（maps）。则有\n<MATHSEG_0001>和<MATHSEG_0002>\n此外，还有\n<MATH_0012>\n其中记号的含义是显然的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所设的概形。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "限定所给的三个分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "限定所给的三个代数。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指所给的三个拟凝聚分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "限定所给的两个代数映射。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "用于表述所给映射的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所给的两个分次代数映射。"}], "notes": []}
